  "description": "***DAFT ENQUIRIES ONLY***\n\nRenville Court is a beautifully kept developement located beside Rinville park and Rinville Harbour, a beautiful tranquil area of Galway this property offers a living style second to none. The developement is located in a mature tranquil developement with park walks, coastal walks, golfing and a newly developed 5-star hotel are all within walking distance of this property.\n\nThe property is a quaint townhouse encompassing two floors. On the ground floor there is an open plan kitchen and sitting room, well sized and beautifully bright throughout it is an excellent space for relaxation and cooking. Overlooking mature and well maintained gardens to the front of the property the ground level is queit and private.\n\nUpstairs there are two double bedrooms, one of which is master suite accompanied by an ensuite. Both rooms benefit from storage and are bright and airy. This property must be seen to be appreciated.",
